//
// Optimizations:
//  - All three GEMMs are written in a "outer-outer-inner" style so that
//    the dimension we traverse in the innermost loop is always the
//    contiguous one in memory for both source and destination matrices.
//  - Accumulators A[i,k], C[j,m], E[i,j] are hoisted out of the inner
//    loop and kept in scalar temporaries.
//  - E, F, and G are zero-initialized once before their respective
//    accumulation phases, instead of inside the inner-most loop.
//
